/* Welcome / onboarding */
"Continue without granting Full Disk Access" = "不授予完全磁盘访问权限并继续";
"Done, Don't Relaunch" = "完成，不重新启动";
"Quit & Relaunch" = "退出并重新启动";
"Open System Settings…" = "打开系统设置…";
"Welcome to FileFluss" = "欢迎使用 FileFluss";
